[PrintTextModified Text:（ああ、ようやくだ）|#0202Bad02_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……なんだかこうしてると、<br>昔を思い出すよね。|#0202Bad02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（ようやく――）|#0202Bad02_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

